                                    <TextBlock
                                           Classes="docs-body"
                                           Text="Use ms-&lt;number&gt;, me-&lt;number&gt;, mbs-&lt;number&gt;, and mbe-&lt;number&gt; utilities when margin should follow the current text direction or writing mode."/>
