                                                      <Border
                                                             Background="{StaticResource BrushSlate950}"
                                                             Padding="24">
                                                            <TextBlock
                                                                   Classes="docs-noteBody"
                                                                   Text="Unsupported: generated StaticResource margin keys only cover physical directions plus negative physical margins (Margin*, MarginX*, MarginY*, MarginTop*, MarginRight*, MarginBottom*, MarginLeft*, and NegativeMargin*). Logical ms-/me-/mbs-/mbe- keys are still parser-only."/>
